A REQUEST, NOT A CONDITION
--------------------------
CC0 imposes no obligations, so this is a request. If you redistribute this data,
carry the `# source:` and `# checked:` lines with it. They are what separate a
dataset someone can verify from another anonymous scrape — which is the problem
this set was built to fix. A copy without provenance recreates it.

NO WARRANTY
-----------
Banks open, close and rename branches. Every bank records the date it was last
checked so you can judge for yourself. Nothing here is a guarantee that a routing
number is currently valid, and it is not a substitute for the receiving bank's
own confirmation before money moves.
